{"asset_key":"ep8/quest_story_18106310","episode":"ep8","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18106310","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1810631001:1":{"text":"領主様が宴を開く目的はなんだ？あの方は、そう簡単に遺恨を水に流すお人ではない。","source_cn":"领主阁下举办这场宴会是有什么谋划？她可不是以德报怨的那种人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B01498496983DFA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1810631002:1":{"text":"それは……申し訳ありませんが、お答えできません。","source_cn":"这个……我恐怕不能告诉您。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA96A4D6B45D2C31","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1810631003:1":{"text":"領主様がどんな報復を用意しているのか知りたいだけだ。何も分からぬままでは、バンティスどもを嘲笑うこともできんだろう。","source_cn":"我只是想知道领主阁下准备怎么报复回去，这样我才知道该怎...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF6BEB52EA1A0C57","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1810631004:1":{"text":"そうだな、質問を変えよう。宴で注意すべきことはあるか？","source_cn":"或者，我换个说法：宴会上有什么需要注意的地方吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74F4705D86F42BAF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1810631005:1":{"text":"……<style=\"highlight\">こちらのテーブルに置かれたお酒</style>にご注意ください。中身が、その……一風変わっておりますので。","source_cn":"……小心<style=highlight>旁边这张餐台...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7143B2BB40201556","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_r